# The verb registry (docs/guide/how-registry.md). Rendered to how-registry.svg by go generate.
title: One Go file declares every command, and go generate writes the rest from it
direction: down
registry: internal/verbs/registry.go: verbs, seats, layers, lanes, gates
cli: CLI commands and flags, built at run time
gen: go generate ./... runs the generators
docs: README tables, LAYERS.md, RACI, charters, AGENTS.md
skills: SKILL.md frontmatter and MCP tool schemas
drift: CI generate-drift job fails on any difference
registry -> cli: read at start
registry -> gen: lint, then render
gen -> docs
gen -> skills
docs -> drift
skills -> drift
